    IF `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i)): "shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000"

-- src:26224 | (4) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:26225 | subsection (1) or (2), the company or foreign company, and every
-- src:26226 | officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, shall
