GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 386AIA(4) the most the company or foreign company or an officer in default may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF (IF `the person is the company or foreign company`
        THEN `s 386AIA(4) the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
        ELSE `s 386AIA(4) the officer of the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2)` `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 25000, 0, FALSE, FALSE)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for the person it makes guilty

