GIVEN `the person` IS A Party
      `the prescribed period, in days` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386AJ act`
`s 386AJ(1) and (2) a person who is a registrable controller must notify the company or foreign company within the prescribed period` MEANS
    PARTY `the person`
    MUST `s 386AJ(1) notify the company or foreign company, state the date and provide the other information`
    WITHIN `the prescribed period, in days`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the person` BECAUSE "the person did not comply with section 386AJ(1) within the prescribed period (s 386AJ(1), (2), (4))"


-- src:26275 | (3) A person need not comply with the requirements of
-- src:26276 | subsection (1) if the person has received a notice from the
