    IF `the person fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i)): "If a person fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2), the person shall be guilty of an offence"

