`s 386AJ(4) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF `s 386AJ(4) the person is guilty of the offence` `the person fails to comply with subsection (1) or (2)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 25000, 0, FALSE, FALSE)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for the person it makes guilty

§ `Section 386AK: the controller's duty to provide change of information`

-- (5): when a relevant change occurs ("occurs if": marginal reading (a)).
-- src:26331 | (5) For the purposes of this section, a relevant change occurs if —
-- src:26333 | (a) a person ceases to be a registrable controller in relation to
-- src:26334 | the company or foreign company, as the case may be; or
-- src:26336 | (b) there is a change in the person’s contact details or such
-- src:26337 | other particulars as may be prescribed.
@ref s 386AK(5) (src:26331-26337)
GIVEN `a person ceases to be a registrable controller in relation to the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there is a change in the person's contact details or such other particulars as may be prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386AK(5) a relevant change occurs` MEANS
    IF    `a person ceases to be a registrable controller in relation to the company or foreign company`
       OR `there is a change in the person's contact details or such other particulars as may be prescribed`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", marginal reading (a)): "For the purposes of this section, a relevant change occurs if — (a) ...; or (b) ..."

-- (1) and (3).
-- src:26293 | 386AK.—(1) A person who is a registrable controller in relation to
-- src:26294 | a company or foreign company who knows, or ought reasonably to
-- src:26295 | know, that a relevant change has occurred in the prescribed
-- src:26296 | particulars of the registrable controller must notify the company or
-- src:26297 | foreign company of the relevant change —
-- src:26299 | (a) stating the date that the change occurred; and
-- src:26301 | (b) providing the particulars of the change.
